  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'maps 502 run_failed'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]
- label: a 200 response with null content and finish_reason stop is surfaced as ViktorEmptyReplyError so callers can distinguish it from an answered turn (opt-in strict mode, default warns)
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'maps an empty 200 reply'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]
- label: 401/403 `{"detail":…}` envelopes are raised as ViktorAuthError with the detail code (invalid_api_key, api_key_inactive, missing scope, identity_denied, compat_api_not_enabled)
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'maps 401 detail envelopes'
