- label: 429 responses are raised as ViktorRateLimitError carrying Retry-After seconds and the code (rate_limit_exceeded, insufficient_quota)
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'maps 429 with Retry-After'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]
- finish_reason `length` after the 600 s run cap is surfaced as a distinct ViktorRunTimeoutError reason on the result, not silently as a normal stop @spec

