- label: the delegate tool creates a Viktor thread over the native REST API, polls the run until it leaves queued/in_progress, and returns status, markdown, json, artifacts, thread_id and run_id
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'creates a thread, polls the run'
