- label: a run that ends in requires_action is returned as a normal tool result whose status is requires_action, not as an error
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'posts to an existing thread'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]
- label: the delegate tool stops polling after timeout_seconds and returns status timed_out with the run_id without cancelling the run
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'returns timed_out'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]
- label: artifacts are returned as display name, content type and a short-lived download URL
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'creates a thread, polls the run'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]

